You may share and adapt the tables for any purpose, provided you give appropriate credit:
cite the accompanying working paper ("Frozen on the Last Open Version", Oh, 2026) and
credit deps.dev (Google Open Source Insights) and Maven Central as the sources of the
underlying package data.

The tables are the author's derived coding. deps.dev states that the data it generates are
available under CC BY 4.0; the underlying package metadata originates from the package
registries, chiefly Maven Central, and remains subject to their own terms. No raw registry
files (such as POM files) are included.
